<title>HONG KONG: Belle Corp mandates US$100 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Belle Corp mandates US$100 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belle Corp has mandated Deutsche Morgan Grenfell to arrange a five-year US$100 million floating rate note issue, bankers said.</p>
<p>Roadshows will be held in late February.</p>
<p>No further details were available.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6371</p>
</text>
